<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% block title %}{{ site_title }}{% endblock %}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ root }}style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="{{ root }}index.html">{{ site_title }}</a>
    <nav class="nav">
      <details class="dropdown">
        <summary>아카이브</summary>
        <ul class="dropdown-list">
          {% for d in dates[:60] %}<li><a href="{{ root }}archive/{{ d }}.html">{{ d }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="dropdown">
        <summary>주제별</summary>
        <ul class="dropdown-list">
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/insurance.html">건강보험·수가</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/workforce.html">의료인력</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/delivery.html">의료전달체계·공공의료</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/infectious.html">감염병·예방</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/pharma.html">약가·의약품·기기</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/digital.html">디지털헬스</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/finance.html">보건재정</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/ltc.html">돌봄·장기요양</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/mental.html">정신건강</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/governance.html">법제·거버넌스</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/global.html">국제보건</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ root }}topics/other.html">기타</a></li>
        </ul>
      </details>
      <button class="search-toggle" type="button" data-search-toggle aria-label="검색">검색</button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="search-panel" data-search-panel hidden>
  <div class="wrap">
    <input type="search" data-search-input placeholder="제목·요약·태그 검색 (최근 90일)" autocomplete="off">
    <div class="search-results" data-search-results></div>
  </div>
</div>
<main class="wrap">
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
</main>
<footer class="site-footer wrap">
  <p>자동 생성된 브리핑입니다. 요약은 AI가 작성했으며 원문 확인을 권장합니다.</p>
</footer>
<script>window.__ROOT__ = "{{ root }}";</script>
<script src="{{ root }}app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
